@startuml
title Allpatek | Agreement and Milestone Flow - Angular Demo
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam dpi 140
hide footbox
actor Merchant
actor Farmer
participant "Angular SPA" as Web
database "JSON Server /\nAzure Mock API" as Mock
participant "n8n webhook\n(external)" as N8n

Merchant -> Web : Open parcel and accept terms
Web -> Mock : Save agreement with merchantSigned
Farmer -> Web : Open request and confirm on /agreements
Web -> Mock : Save farmerSigned
Web -> N8n : Request agreement notice after save
note over Web,Mock : Vault lists agreements with both flags.\nNo bank confirmation or Spring connection.
Farmer -> Web : Attach photo to an open milestone
Web -> N8n : Request evidence notice before save
Web -> Mock : Save evidence as review
Merchant -> Web : Verify evidence on /evidence/review
Web -> Mock : Update review to verified
Merchant -> Web : Release milestone on /escrow
note right of Web : Demo card and sufficient\nremaining balance required.
Web -> Mock : PUT reduced evidence as accepted
Web -> N8n : Request payout notice if UI reports success
note over Web,Mock
  Release is a status change, not a funds transfer.
  The reduced PUT omits notes and file data;
  its HTTP error can be reported as success.
end note
@enduml
